        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever given away your old books? One "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "charity",
            "ref": "v-charity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shop in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Scotland",
            "zh": "苏格兰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is very happy that someone did. Workers found a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " book in a pile of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "donated",
            "zh": "捐赠的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " books. It was a special copy of "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Hobbit"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《霍比特人》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Hobbit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is a famous fantasy book. It was first published in 1937. The book found in the shop is a special "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "edition",
            "ref": "v-edition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is more than 50 years old. Only about 1,500 copies of this edition were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Most of them were sent to school libraries. Today, people believe only 50 copies still "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The cover shows a bright picture of the dragon Smaug."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The shop owner was very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “It is a beautiful old book with its own magic,” he said. “Finding a book like this is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for any bookseller. We never expected something so "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to appear among the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "donations",
            "ref": "v-donation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The shop "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the book for £3,000. This was the most money the shop had ever made from one item. The money will be given to charity to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people in need. Sometimes, an old book can make a big "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It also reminds us that small actions, like "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "giving away",
            "ref": "v-give-away"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " old things, can bring "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " results."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
